{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take the throne and fix the corrupt kingdom\u2014 or worsen it!</strong></i> A stat-raising life sim and visual novel where you are the villainess. There are 4 love interests who can become your ally or enemy. Your choices will affect your stats and the entire nation's story. Includes hundreds of manhwa-style artworks hand-drawn by me. How will you rule?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fPrincess-raising sim x Kingdom Management x Otome isekai villainess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/c0c5c71fee49389a3a2cfe50ce8b922e.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/9a48559d874f625093ce35b2e20864c3.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Iriyn is riddled with issues like a stagnant economy, shaky foreign relations, and a dissatisfied public. You can try to fix these, or make it worse for the sake of chasing personal wealth and power. Your choices will determine what happens to the world, and what people say about you. Beware of the 'scandal sheet' newspapers that try to slander you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <i><strong>Setting:</strong></i> A fantasy pseudo-European world inspired by the 19th century, governed by aristocracy. Similar to the world of most Otome Isekai stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/47212cd6fbc6cd10dba86769555d316e.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/143390030bc307867394cad3ebec2a8e.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every decision will affect various stats</strong></i>, whether it's your personal skills, the country's domestic issues or foreign relations. These stats determine the story and future choices that you will get. Think carefully about your priorities as each decision has its trade-offs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/5c852f240c1fdf373c60ce4e312ea3fa.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/e89afd4324db99c66b17024044ee682c.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and stats will determine the story and the ending. Replay the game to discover all the different routes you can get! You can <i><strong>succeed or fail, be good or evil, have allies or enemies, allow freedom or become a dictator.</strong></i>.. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/725b0b9977fdff6a0ed501bb88b26457.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/432bd61c0ec4408ff11e0f526af7cbfc.avif?t=1774129844\" width=616 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can expand your territory in a hostile way, or to increase your influence through soft power. Charm the key characters of each nation to win alliances (or make enemies). Romancing your rivals could also be a way of foreign policy! Your personal relationships  can also affect the stats of your country, so be careful who you befriend and offend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/6c7f4fe5dcc7fb6ec77ec82270c7e25c.avif?t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lady Lucena Sariez, whom the public has branded as a 'villainess'. Will you fix your reputation, or double down on the villainess route?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/061863aaa204baef1201c51483e645bd.avif?t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f The Duke of the North was supposed to have a political marriage with Lucena, until he announced his surprising engagement to Rosalie. He is also vying for the throne, making him Lucena's nemesis. He is  sharper than a winter icicle, but what's hiding behind his icy exterior?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d Romanceable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/de816b23123abffc7b9ead04634daafc.avif?t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Rosalie, born as a commoner, has become the popular 'saintess' and beloved idol of the public because of her soft personality. Even though she took Lucena's place, she secretly idolises Lucena. Now, she's only a budding spring flower in the court of Iriyn, but time will reveal her potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d Romanceable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/0b26ad73a1c98558e53a6c04d5f31c7e.avif?t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Aeriselle is  like the summer sun of her homeland, Atissia. Sometimes warm, and sometimes the beginning of a wildfire. She's sweet, dangerous, and slightly arrogant. Depending on your choices, she could become a formidable ally or fatal enemy, or something in between?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d Romanceable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/da228d7b30310d0a029df1d3cbdf0b6b.avif?t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf41 Helius Bloom is the face of Bloom Media's entertainment and news empire. He would be an invaluable asset to any political campaign, if you can get him on your side. On the surface, he's totally the image of perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of other characters from various nations for you to meet!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Game functions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save/Load slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip, Back, and Dialogue History</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the text speed and auto 'skip' settings</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541340?t=1774129844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541340?t=1774129844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/0d44a59444762122a04ac937ebdee03ff4716b53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774129844"