t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Rosalie, born as a commoner, has become the popular 'saintess' and beloved idol of the public because of her soft personality. Even though she took Lucena's place, she secretly idolises Lucena. Now, she's only a budding spring flower in the court of Iriyn, but time will reveal her potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d Romanceable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/0b26ad73a1c98558e53a6c04d5f31c7e.avif?t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Aeriselle is  like the summer sun of her homeland, Atissia. Sometimes warm, and sometimes the beginning of a wildfire. She's sweet, dangerous, and slightly arrogant. Depending on your choices, she could become a formidable ally or fatal enemy, or something in between?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0d Romanceable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/extras/da228d7b30310d0a029df1d3cbdf0b6b.avif?t=1774129844\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf41 Helius Bloom is the face of Bloom Media's entertainment and news empire. He would be an invaluable asset to any political campaign, if you can get him on your side. On the surface, he's totally the image of perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of other characters from various nations for you to meet!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Game functions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save/Load slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip, Back, and Dialogue History</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the text speed and auto 'skip' settings</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lyyycaena"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541340/e76fc733f8b54e1560f429e97650baed6564744b/header.jpg?t=1774129844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu / SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX or OpenGL compatible card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.6 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz, Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX or OpenGL compatible card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Game is non-notarized. May not work well with 10.15 Catalina</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3541340/1115764355/ab8a2cd33ddca17266bd5c5bbca8e726d4532803/1764950633/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764951034","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3541340/1115764355/ab8a2cd33ddca17266bd5c5bbca8e726d4532803/1764950633/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764951034","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3541340/1115764355/ab8a2cd33ddca17266bd5c5bbca8e726d4532803/1764950633/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764951034","id":257099482,"name":"Game Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.